    "detailed_description": "Cross-playable, competitive online game<br />\r\n<br />\r\n3-player battle for the win!<br />\r\nYou win when your opponent is knocked off the field or reduced to 0 HP!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEquip 2 specials, 2 weapons, and armor to fight.<br />\r\nCollect unique items and find the strongest combination!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n1 vs 1 single mode<br />\r\n2 vs. 2 cooperative multiplayer mode<br />\r\nFight together with a friend in the cooperative multiplayer mode!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nControls<br />\r\nQ: Dash<br />\r\nW: Use Special 1<br />\r\nE: Use Special 2<br />\r\nR: Use Weapon 1<br />\r\nT:Use Weapon 2",
